SUMMARY:Music on the River- ft. Jennie Laws
DESCRIPTION:Toronto SUP\, Kayak & Canoe Adventures - Meetup Group\nJam wit
 h us in ours boats to Jennie Laws' tunes! To book your spot\, please go to
  the link:\n*[https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/music-shows-on-t
 he-river/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/music-shows-on-the-
 river/)*\nLink shows live boat availability and options!\n\nLocated on Tor
 onto’s beautiful Humber River our Music On The River event starts at our
  Humber Paddling centre which is only a 5-Minute walk from Old Mill TTC St
 ation! Upon arrival we’ll get you signed in and set you up with your boa
 t and equipment before you embark on your scenic paddle of the meandering 
 Humber River before enjoying a 45-Minute set from Popular Local Toronto Ar
 tists!\n\n**Events are subject to weather and other factors out of our con
 trol. If we must cancel or delay an event we will let you know as soon as 
 possible.**\n\n**Booking and Pricing:**\n[https://torontoadventures.ca/all
