 5 +taxes\nTandem Kayak (seats 2 people) : $89.95 +taxes\nRegular Canoe (se
 ats 2 people) : $79.95 +taxes\nLarge Canoe (seats 3 people) : $99.95 +taxe
 s\nStand Up Paddleboard (1 person) : $49.95 +taxes\nSeat in a Voyageur Can
 oe (1 person) : $39.95 +taxes\nBring Your Own Boat (boat/equipment): $9.95
  +taxes\n\n**What's Included:**\n\n* Boat(s)\n* Paddle(s)\n* PFD(s) “Lif
 ejackets”\n* A concert right on the river!\n* Our experienced staff to h
 elp you every step of the way!\n\n**What to Bring:**\n\n* Dress for the we
 ather!\n* Sunscreen\, Sunglasses & Hats\, are all recommended for sunny da
 ys!\n* We recommend securely fastened footwear (footwear is not required f
 or SUPs).\n* Blanket to keep you cozy during the show\n* Snacks & Drinks (
 Non Alcoholic)\n* Don’t forget your Cameras!\n\n**[Google Link Direction
 s](https://torontoadventures.ca/directions/#humberriverlocation)**\n**[Can
 cellation Policy](https://torontoadventures.ca/faq/#cancellation)**[ ](htt
 ps://torontoadventures.ca/faq/#cancellation)\n\nWe hope to see you out on 
